    {"claim": "With no historical loss data for novel systems, an insurer cannot set a premium without demanding demonstrated safety mechanisms — turning premium-setting into a continuous audit the negligence model never triggers.", "targets": [], "relationship": ""},
    {"claim": "Negligence produces a circular firing squad — the developer blames the deployer, the deployer blames the user, and the injured party recovers nothing from any of them.", "targets": [], "relationship": ""},
    {"claim": "Strict liability belongs where the harm is high-stakes and hard to reverse — autonomous vehicles, clinical decision systems — not as a blanket rule.", "targets": [], "relationship": ""}
